sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Game Client
    participant CM as Connection Manager
    participant GH as Game Handler
    participant GSM as Game State Manager
    participant PC as Phase Controller
    participant VS as Voting Service
    participant USH as User Status Handler

    Note over Client,USH: Game Auto-Start Flow
    Client->>CM: Player joins game
    CM->>GH: Check if max players reached
    GH->>GSM: Get game state
    GSM-->>GH: Game state with connected players
    
    alt Max players reached
        GH->>GH: _auto_start_game()
        GH->>GSM: start_game_phases()
        GH->>USH: auto_update_status_on_game_start()
        
        Note over GH,PC: Setup Phase Callbacks
        GH->>PC: add_phase_change_callback()
        GH->>PC: add_phase_timer_callback()
        
        GH->>CM: broadcast GAME_STARTED message
        CM->>Client: Game started notification
    end

    Note over Client,USH: Phase Management Flow
    PC->>GH: _on_phase_changed(old_phase, new_phase)
    GH->>GSM: get_or_create_game_state()
    GH->>PC: get_phase_info()
    GH->>CM: broadcast WsPhaseChangedMessage
    CM->>Client: Phase change notification
    
    alt new_phase == VOTING
        GH->>GH: _start_day_voting()
        GH->>VS: create_voting_session()
        GH->>VS: start_voting_session()
        GH->>CM: broadcast WsVotingStartedMessage
        CM->>Client: Voting started notification
    end

    Note over Client,USH: Timer Updates
    loop Phase Duration
        PC->>GH: _on_phase_timer(phase, time_remaining)
        GH->>CM: broadcast WsTimerMessage
        CM->>Client: Timer update
    end

    Note over Client,USH: Game Status Broadcasting
    GH->>GH: build_game_status_message()
    GH->>CM: broadcast WsMessageGameStatus
    CM->>Client: Game status update

    Note over Client,USH: Error Handling
    alt Error occurs
        GH->>GH: _send_error()
        GH->>CM: send_personal_message(error)
        CM->>Client: Error notification
    end